* Anna Deavere Smith’s verbatim performance works such as *Fires in the Mirror* / *Twilight: Los Angeles, 1992*, treated as performative hinges between stage/audience, witness and community;
* the performance piece Bravehearts: Men in Skirts, used as an example of a performative/pedagogical hinge that crosses gendered inside/outside boundaries.

The Chicago Symphony Orchestra’s Education Center is not one of the architectural/performance cases mobilised in *Places of Learning* for the pedagogy’s hinge argument.

